false,"text":"Since he grew up in a single-parent household with his mother as his only parent, he wants to become independent as soon as possible and support her life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is aware of he might seem to be something of a \"mama's boy\", he has a desire for his mother who is forever young and beautiful, a love which goes beyond the familial. He feels that he is abnormal and experiences angst over these feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Adapted from EroGameScape character description,"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33106"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。都内の某私立大学に通う2年生。19歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学業優秀でスポーツも比較的得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眉目秀麗なハンサムだが、いまどきの若者にしては言葉数が少なく、やや無愛想。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異性には、その寡黙で落ち着いた立ち居振る舞いが神秘的に映るらしく、かなりモテるほうだが浮ついた付き合いを好まないため、現在特定の彼女はいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から母一人子一人の母子家庭で育ってきたため、早く自立して生活を支えたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間一般の母子関係と比較してマザコンの傾向が強いことを自覚しているが、いつまでも若く美しい母の姿に家族に対しての愛情以上の欲望を抱いており、自分のことを異常だと感じて悩み苦しんでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10476","sourceWorkId":"15043","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"19 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10476","sourceWorkId":"15043","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"180 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10476","sourceWorkId":"15043","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"65 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10476","sourceWorkId":"15043","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79397e099885db3bd8cd8f29d526919464dde28cb9db580b900ea66809d9fa68.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c9ed977af078adc572e7ab5fd4827410b93a7e446c6d96e0739dc5b49f6c826.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"st